157
00:25:18,893 --> 00:25:20,528
What about our apartment?

158
00:25:20,528 --> 00:25:21,586
Uhhhh...

159
00:25:21,730 --> 00:25:23,934
What about US?

160
00:25:26,768 --> 00:25:28,956
Don't cry, Nina.

161
00:25:30,238 --> 00:25:32,171
I love you.

162
00:25:33,875 --> 00:25:35,900
You could come here...

